			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"### Seedance 2.0 简介\n**Seedance 2.0** 是字节跳动Seed团队推出的**多模态视频生成大模型**，主打**导演级可控+原生音画同步+工业级质量**，支持文本/图像/音频/视频混合输入，可生成**4K分辨率**的带音效视频。\n\n\n\n---\n\n### 提示词模板（@系统示例）\n```\n[风格] A cinematic, ultra-detailed, 8K, realistic video\n[主体] of a young warrior @image1 standing on a cliff\n[动作] drawing a sword, slow motion, dynamic pose\n[运镜] epic wide shot, slow push-in, dramatic lighting\n[参考] camera movement from @video1, ambient sound from @audio1\n[质量] masterpiece, best quality, physics-based, consistent character\n\n```\n"
			],
